      "date": "2026-05-24T23:00:33.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS in line with expectations, revenues disappoint",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹21.00 (up from ₹17.70 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹6.46b (up 9.7% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹826.5m (up 19% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (up from 12% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) were mostly in line with analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 14% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 9.0% growth forecast for the Leisure industry in Asia.",
